B1 = Counterparty (the other party's name, verbatim)
C1 = Effective date (YYYY-MM-DD)
D1 = Governing law (jurisdiction only, e.g. Delaware)
E1 = Term and renewal (one line: length, and whether it auto-renews)
F1 = Change of control or assignment: classify as exactly one of: Consent required / Notice only / Unrestricted / Not found
G1 = Liability cap (a formula like "12 months' fees", a currency amount, "uncapped", or "Not found")
H1 = Termination for convenience by our side: "Yes, N days" or "No"
I1 = Non-compete or exclusivity binding us or a key person: "None" or a one-line summary
